sequenceDiagram
    participant APP as Application
    participant API as Application Backend
    participant S as Bale Safir

    APP->>API: Create delivery intent
    API->>API: Persist intent and stable request_id
    API->>S: POST /api/v3/send_message
    Note over API,S: api-access-key is sent server-side only
    S-->>API: Provider response
    API->>API: Persist delivery result

    opt Retry of the same logical message
        API->>S: Retry with the same request_id
        S-->>API: Idempotent provider handling
    end
